  data: {
    LLM: "Always protect your 10s. Since they are worth 10 points for 'Game', losing one can forfeit the Game point entirely.\n\nThe Discard: When running the cards and discarding to 6, throw away your low cards in non-trump suits to increase your chances of being 'void' and thus able to trump early.\n\nDealer Strategy: If an opponent begs and you hold the King or Jack of trumps, strongly consider 'Gifting' the 1 point. It's often safer than risking a new trump suit where they might find the Ace.",
    Player: "Always protect your 10s. Since they are worth 10 points for 'Game', losing one can forfeit the Game point entirely.\n\nThe Discard: When running the cards and discarding to 6, throw away your low cards in non-trump suits to increase your chances of being 'void' and thus able to trump early.\n\nDealer Strategy: If an opponent begs and you hold the King or Jack of trumps, strongly consider 'Gifting' the 1 point. It's often safer than risking a new trump suit where they might find the Ace.",
