      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Low belongs to the holder. If you have the 2 of trumps, it is yours even if you lose that trick.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "In 4-player games, leading a small trump can smoke out the opponent's Jack if your partner holds the Ace.",
